cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research prototype, cite the repository and identify the exact commit or version used."
title: "Khmer-to-Ukrainian Phonetic-Graphemic Correspondence System"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ClippyFirst/Khmer-Ukrainian-Phonetic-System-"
url: "https://github.com/ClippyFirst/Khmer-Ukrainian-Phonetic-System-"
authors:
  - name: "ClippyFirst contributors"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-gated research prototype for Khmer orthographic structure,
  partial phonological and typed IPA analysis, and practical Ukrainian
  correspondence. It is not a validated complete Khmer grapheme-to-phoneme
  system or a substitute for expert-adjudicated pronunciation data.
keywords:
  - Khmer
  - Cambodian
  - grapheme-to-phoneme
  - IPA
  - Ukrainian transcription
  - phonology
  - research software
